      "content": "hey our main refrigeration unit on the truck heading to the tokyo warehouse just tripped a sensor and the temp is climbing fast. everything in there is high grade sashimi. what do i need to do right now to minimize spoilage and what's the protocol for checking if the product is still safe to sell?",
