    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the driver says the sensor trip happened out of nowhere. one minute it was fine, the next it just glitched and the temp started spiking. it feels like some kind of weird electrical failure or something. we're looking at the logs now but it doesn't show a clear reason why the cooling system just shut down like that. any idea why a unit would just fail like that suddenly?",
